cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "LLMs for Pull Request Acceptance Prediction and Flag Identification: An Annotated Dataset and Evaluation (replication package)"
abstract: "Replication package for a study of whether large language models can predict pull request acceptance and identify the green (positive) and red (negative) flags that human annotators associate with a PR's outcome. It contains 300 manually annotated PR-issue pairs from six open-source repositories, annotated with a 24-flag impact-weighted taxonomy, together with the prompting scripts, raw model predictions, and evaluation results for four LLMs under zero-, one-, and few-shot prompting."
